        {
          "text": "Yucepu owaco ki omegine ki jo ma i ot pa wonne ni, “Abidok ka tito ki Parao, abiwacce ni, ‘Omega ki jo ma i ot pa wora, ma yam gitye i lobo Kanaan, doŋ gutyeko bino bota; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.31"
            ]
